れて行ってくれるんだよね……？","source_cn":"所以……你们可以，带我回家……对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36B0484A7671CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321606014:0":{"text":"ええ！？どうしてそんな話になるんですか！？","source_cn":"——等一下，怎么又扯到带你回家的事了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209683BED0080AC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321606015:1":{"text":"家はどこにあるんですか？そういえば、まだ名前も聞いてなかったですね。","source_cn":"你的家在哪？对了，我们还不知道你的名字呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5542478A67910C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321606016:1":{"text":"僕は……デミ……","source_cn":"名字是……德米……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71511885DAE486A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321606017:0":{"text":"家の場所が……分からない……でもお母さんがそこで、僕の帰りを待ってる……","source_cn":"我的家在……我不知道在哪……但是母亲在那里，我要去找母亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x910B5C8D7D40119D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321606018:0":{"text":"うーん、家の場所を簡単に忘れられるものでしょうか……","source_cn":"唔，忘记家在哪就难办了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6B9D4055616B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321606019:0":{"text":"だいたいの場所でもいいんです。あるいは……印象に残ってる景色とか。たとえ記憶を失ったとしても、心が覚えているはずです！","source_cn":"大概的位置你还能想起来吗？或者……记忆比较深刻的地方也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0693E9F5173E0FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321606020:1":{"text":"印象に残ってる景色……<style=\"highlight\">南にある湖</style>に氷が張っていて、大きな穴が開いている。それから……<style=\"highlight\">北にある崖の上</style>……廃墟の中に美味しい果物がある……","source_cn":"印象深刻的……<style=highlight>南边的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282EF85A802CAB74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321606021:1":{"text":"まったく正反対の方向ですね……","source_cn":"真奇怪，他印象深刻的两个地方刚好方向相反呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44106F3C4639C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321606022:0":{"text":"とにかく、ひとまず見に行ってみましょう！どちらかの近くに、彼の家があるかもしれません！","source_cn":"算了，我们还是先过去看看吧！说不定他家就在这两个地方附近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6353ABAB81BED832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"じゃあ、どうして君はここに？","source_cn":"那你为什么会在这里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6B86206B